meta {
  name: User Registration
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "Aditi Sharma",
    "email": "aditi.sharma@example.in",
    "password": "Password123!",
    "role": "founder",
    "startupName": "AgroNext Dynamics",
    "industry": "AgriTech",
    "phone": "+91 98765 43210"
  }
}

docs {
  # User Registration
  Register a new Founder or Mentor account on the platform.

  ### Authentication
  Public (No authorization header required)

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Guest

  ### Request Body Fields
  - `name` (string, required) - Full name of the user.
  - `email` (string, required) - Unique email address.
  - `password` (string, required) - Password (min 8 characters).
  - `role` (string, required) - Role to register as: "founder" or "mentor".
  - `startupName` (string, optional) - Required if registering as founder.
  - `industry` (string, optional) - Industry category if founder.
  - `phone` (string, optional) - Indian phone number (+91).

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `201` - Account registered successfully.
  - `400` - Validation failed or missing required fields.
  - `409` - Email address already registered.
  - `500` - Internal server error.

  ### Response Example (201)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Account created successfully",
    "user": {
      "id": "usr_founder_02",
      "name": "Aditi Sharma",
      "email": "aditi.sharma@example.in",
      "role": "founder",
      "status": "active"
    }
  }
  ```
}
